---
import SectionCornerControls from "./SectionCornerControls.astro";
---

<section
  id="mp-systems"
  class="flooring-scroll is-loading"
  data-flooring-scroll
  data-layer-coverage-ratio="0.9"
  aria-labelledby="flooring-title"
>
  <div class="flooring-sticky">
    <SectionCornerControls instanceId="flooring" />

    <canvas
      class="flooring-canvas"
      data-flooring-canvas
      aria-label="Modelo tridimensional de un sistema de suelo multicapa"
      data-i18n-aria-label="mp_systems_canvas_aria"
    ></canvas>

    <div class="flooring-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="flooring-loader" data-flooring-loader role="status" aria-live="polite">
      <span class="flooring-loading-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p data-flooring-loader-message data-i18n="mp_systems_loading">Cargando sistema 3D</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flooring-copy-stack" aria-live="polite">
      <article class="flooring-copy-panel is-active" data-flooring-panel="0">
        <p class="flooring-eyebrow" data-i18n="mp_systems_intro_eyebrow">MP SYSTEM</p>
        <h2 id="flooring-title" data-i18n="mp_systems_intro_title">Un sistema construido capa a capa.</h2>
        <p data-i18n="mp_systems_intro_text">Desliza para descubrir qué hay debajo de un acabado MyPerol.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="flooring-copy-panel" data-flooring-panel="1">
        <p class="flooring-step">01</p>
        <p class="flooring-eyebrow" data-i18n="mp_systems_primer_eyebrow">ADHERENCIA</p>
        <h2 data-i18n="mp_systems_primer_title">Imprimación</h2>
        <p data-i18n="mp_systems_primer_text">Consolida el soporte y crea una unión fiable con el sistema de resina.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="flooring-copy-panel" data-flooring-panel="2">
        <p class="flooring-step">02</p>
        <p class="flooring-eyebrow" data-i18n="mp_systems_silica_eyebrow">ESTRUCTURA</p>
        <h2 data-i18n="mp_systems_silica_title">Árido de sílice</h2>
        <p data-i18n="mp_systems_silica_text">Refuerza el conjunto, regula el espesor y mejora su comportamiento mecánico.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="flooring-copy-panel" data-flooring-panel="3">
        <p class="flooring-step">03</p>
        <p class="flooring-eyebrow" data-i18n="mp_systems_epoxy_eyebrow">CONTINUIDAD</p>
        <h2 data-i18n="mp_systems_epoxy_title">Resina epoxi</h2>
        <p data-i18n="mp_systems_epoxy_text">Aporta continuidad, diseño y resistencia a toda la superficie.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="flooring-copy-panel" data-flooring-panel="4">
        <p class="flooring-step">04</p>
        <p class="flooring-eyebrow" data-i18n="mp_systems_sealer_eyebrow">PROTECCIÓN</p>
        <h2 data-i18n="mp_systems_sealer_title">Sellador transparente</h2>
        <p data-i18n="mp_systems_sealer_text">La terminación final protege el sistema sin ocultar su acabado.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="flooring-copy-panel flooring-copy-final" data-flooring-panel="5">
        <p class="flooring-eyebrow" data-i18n="mp_systems_final_eyebrow">MYPEROL</p>
        <h2 data-i18n="mp_systems_final_title">La resistencia está en todo el sistema.</h2>
        <p data-i18n="mp_systems_final_text">Cuatro capas trabajando sobre una base preparada para durar.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="flooring-progress" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="flooring-progress-bar"></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import "../scripts/flooring/bootstrap";
</script>
